<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<run ensureRobinCafe()>>
<<set $robinCafe.stage to 5>><<set $robinCafe.ended to "quit">>
"You don't need to keep working at the cafe," you say. "You can spend that time on the stand instead."
<br><br>
Robin looks down at the folded work schedule in <<his>> hands. After a few seconds,
<<he>> places it on the desk without opening it. "I'll tell <<nnpc_him "Sam">> tomorrow.
<<nnpc_He "Sam">>'ll probably understand... <<nnpc_He "Sam">> usually does."
<br><br>
Robin turns towards the window and stays quiet for a few seconds before speaking again.
<br><br>
"I'm still glad I worked there. I learned how to use the machine that records orders and payments, and I got better at dealing with angry customers.
I'll still know how to do those things even after I leave."<<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><<lrtrauma>>
