:: Robin Cafe Decision Own
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<run ensureRobinCafe()>>
<<set $robinCafe.stage to 5>>
"It's your job, not mine," you say. "You get to decide whether you want to keep it."
<br><br>
Robin watches you, waiting for you to tell <<him>> what to do. When you say nothing else,
<<he>> looks back down at the paper.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 55 or $robinCafe.handled is "robin">>
	<<set $robinCafe.ended to "kept">>
	<<He>> opens the folded work schedule and reads it again.
	"I'm keeping the job. The money helps, obviously. But I want to stay too."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> picks up a pen and writes <<his>> name beside the hours <<he>> wants to work. This time, <<he>> makes the decision without waiting for you to tell <<him>> what to do.
	<<npcincr Robin dom 5>><<npcincr Robin trauma -4>><<ggdom>><<llrtrauma>>
