	<<He>> puts a hand on the paper. "The stand is mine. I don't want to keep spending so little time on it."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> moves the paper aside. "I'll tell <<nnpc_him "Sam">> myself. I want to do that part."
	<<npcincr Robin dom 3>><<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><<gdom>><<lrtrauma>>
