:: Robin Cafe Shortage Cover
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
You tell Robin to take some money from the cafe's cash register and go to the corner shop to buy more supplies. You offer to take care of <<his>> customers until <<he>> gets back.
<br><br>
"You'd do that?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>
Before you can answer, a customer calls for help at the counter. You turn to serve the customer, while Robin takes the money <<he>> needs from the register and hurries out to the shop.
<br><br>
While Robin is gone, you have to serve both your usual tables and the people waiting at <<his>> counter. Every time you finish one drink, another customer seems to be waiting to order, and several unfinished drinks are still waiting to be collected.
