:: Robin Cafe Shortage Cover 2
<<effects>>
Robin returns from the shop carrying two cartons of $phase against <<his>> chest. <<Hes>> holding the receipt between <<his>> teeth because both hands are full. Robin puts the cartons down, takes the receipt from <<his>> mouth, and sees how many drinks still need to be made. <<He>> joins you behind the counter and starts preparing them.
<br><br>
You and Robin work together until the last people waiting for their drinks have been served.
<br><br>
By the time you finish, both of you are tired. The customers have their orders, and there is enough $phase in the cafe for the next drinks.
