"Keep serving the customers," you tell Robin. "I'll go get more."
<br><br>
You take money from your own pocket and hurry to the corner shop. After buying two cartons of $phase, you carry them back to the cafe. Your arms begin to ache from carrying both at once, so you hold them against your chest to make them easier to carry.
