<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
When you return, Robin is still serving the queue.
<<He>> has crossed out the drinks that need $phase on the cafe's menu board, so customers know they cannot order them. <<Hes>> also helping people choose other drinks.
<br><br>
You put the fresh $phase into the fridge. As soon as you close the door, Robin steps over and hugs you tightly.
