:: Robin Cafe Shortage Substitute
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
You take Robin into the cafe kitchen and start checking the cupboards and shelves to see if there's anything you can use instead of $phase.
<br><br>
<<if $phase is "milk">>
	There is no fresh milk left. At the back of one shelf, you find a packet of powdered milk from an old delivery mistake.
	You pour some of the powdered milk into a jug and add warm water. You mix it until the powder has completely dissolved, then put the jug in a bowl filled with ice and water so the milk cools down more quickly.
	<br><br>
	When the milk is cold enough to use, you hand the jug to Robin and show <<him>> how much powder and water you used.
<<else>>
	There is no cream left, but you find milk and butter in the fridge.
	You pour the milk into a cold bowl, then add small amounts of soft butter while mixing everything together. Robin watches you continue mixing until the butter and milk have combined and the liquid has become thicker.
	<br><br>
	Once it is thick enough for the drinks waiting outside, you show Robin how much milk and butter you used.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Robin Cafe Shortage Substitute 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Robin Cafe Shortage Substitute 2
